# KA Engineering Agent

AI-assisted structural survey interpretation and CAD drawing generation.

## Roof Support Layout process

Start with the [saved workflow](docs/roof-support-layout-workflow.md),
[reusable rules](docs/roof-support-layout-rules.json),
[KA sheet standard](docs/drawing-sheet-standard.md) and
[empty project template](templates/roof-support-project.json).
Agent entry instructions are in [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md).

The workflow applies to any site. Previous project dimensions and geometry are
not defaults. Chimney elevations and telecom steelwork detail drawings are separate
processes awaiting engineer instructions. The saved procedure does not imply that
a general automatic survey interpreter has already been implemented.
